00:16:01,730 --> 00:16:05,670
but it's the old Peter Boyer farmhouse on Route

275
00:16:05,670 --> 00:16:10,090
88 before you get down to Foodland. That's on

276
00:16:10,090 --> 00:16:11,090
the left-hand side.

