00:16:12,870 --> 00:16:17,990
It's a beautiful, beautiful home. And there

278
00:16:17,990 --> 00:16:23,430
again, the Bolanders, who are great antique

279
00:16:23,430 --> 00:16:27,730
experts, took that house when it was in a

