00:16:34,630 --> 00:16:39,530
and they have they rebuilt it and refurbished it

284
00:16:39,530 --> 00:16:41,830
and it's just a perfectly beautiful house so

285
00:16:41,830 --> 00:16:45,630
they're you know there's always so those few in

286
00:16:45,630 --> 00:16:48,470
the community that see beauty in old things and

287
00:16:48,470 --> 00:16:52,390
have a potential see potential yes it's just an

288
00:16:52,390 --> 00:16:56,950
old run-down place and they say uh and so

289
00:16:56,950 --> 00:16:59,910
I hope that if you didn't know about this,

290
00:16:59,970 --> 00:17:03,990
that you will remember now that the Dom home is

291
00:17:03,990 --> 00:17:08,870
actually the farmhouse of George Marshall.

292
00:17:09,250 --> 00:17:12,110
And he had over 100 acres.

293
00:17:13,610 --> 00:17:16,130
And I hope to get his inventory.

