00:17:18,690 --> 00:17:19,630
interested in reading.

296
00:17:19,630 --> 00:17:22,510
But I think

297
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:23,830
an inventory is always

298
00:17:23,830 --> 00:17:26,190
a value because

299
00:17:26,190 --> 00:17:28,430
then you know what he had in terms of

300
00:17:28,430 --> 00:17:29,490
livestock and

301
00:17:30,050 --> 00:17:30,750
other

302
00:17:31,790 --> 00:17:32,730
the farm

303
00:17:33,750 --> 00:17:36,110
aspect of it which doesn't always

