00:17:36,110 --> 00:17:37,310
come out in the will

305
00:17:40,070 --> 00:17:41,710
some of it very briefly

306
00:17:41,710 --> 00:17:43,850
some of the things that I think he is

307
00:17:43,850 --> 00:17:46,090
the most noted for

308
00:17:47,410 --> 00:17:48,450
is the fact

309
00:17:48,450 --> 00:17:52,630
that he did promote education he was the founder

310
00:17:52,630 --> 00:17:54,690
and for many years the

311
00:17:55,310 --> 00:17:59,570
Language, Hebrew, he taught Hebrew and Latin. He

312
00:17:59,570 --> 00:18:03,910
spoke fluently both languages at Bethel Academy.

313
00:18:05,490 --> 00:18:10,690
He was also a trustee of Jefferson College and

314
00:18:10,690 --> 00:18:13,890
through the years the financial condition of the

315
00:18:13,890 --> 00:18:17,990
college began to deteriorate and he would take

316
00:18:17,990 --> 00:18:22,290
trips throughout and travel in those days was

317
00:18:22,290 --> 00:18:24,810
