337
00:19:37,590 --> 00:19:45,470
The second meeting house, which we said was

338
00:19:45,470 --> 00:19:47,450
built during Reverend Woods's pastorate,

339
00:19:48,650 --> 00:19:53,650
was torn down, and a third meeting house brick

340
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:54,830
