00:19:55,060 --> 00:20:01,080
In 1855, and it's rather interesting that about

342
00:20:01,080 --> 00:20:06,540
10 years later, the first organ was purchased

343
00:20:06,540 --> 00:20:11,460
for the church. Doesn't that boggle your mind

344
00:20:11,460 --> 00:20:15,080
when music is so much a part of what we do here

345
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:20,640
in Bethel that it took them up until 1866 before

346
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:24,680
they decided to add an organ?

347
00:20:25,060 --> 00:20:28,200
To the church and it was with great hesitancy

348
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:30,220
