435
00:25:29,820 --> 00:25:32,980
Your kind note was received last evening on my

436
00:25:32,980 --> 00:25:35,900
return from New York and as you request and I

437
00:25:35,900 --> 00:25:39,760
promised I hereby scratch down a few lines to

438
00:25:39,760 --> 00:25:42,240
let you know my whereabouts and scenes through

439
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:46,300
which I have strayed since I last saw you. On

440
00:25:46,300 --> 00:25:48,680
the night I left you I got safely aboard

441
00:25:48,680 --> 00:25:51,540
and here is the real tragedy we don't know what

442
00:25:51,540 --> 00:25:53,440
the name of the packet was that he took.

443
00:25:55,260 --> 00:25:58,560
Are you aware that in order to take the canal

444
00:25:58,560 --> 00:26:02,080
boat from Pittsburgh to Philadelphia, you would

445
00:26:02,080 --> 00:26:06,040
go into town, you would take the, you would get

446
00:26:06,040 --> 00:26:08,840
the canal boat there, and it went across a

447
00:26:08,840 --> 00:26:12,320
viaduct to cross the Allegheny River, and then

448
00:26:12,320 --> 00:26:18,960
up along the Allegheny to beyond Natrona

449
00:26:18,960 --> 00:26:22,060
Heights, up in that area, and then crossed over

450
00:26:22,060 --> 00:26:24,000
