451
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:26,120
And you had to take that railroad.

452
00:26:27,620 --> 00:26:29,700
Are you familiar with this at all?

453
00:26:29,860 --> 00:26:32,340
I brought along some pictures.

454
00:26:33,440 --> 00:26:36,080
Here's a picture of the way

455
00:26:36,080 --> 00:26:40,260
people sat on the top of the canal boat

456
00:26:40,260 --> 00:26:42,480
and passed that around.

457
00:26:46,010 --> 00:26:48,520
This will maybe while I'm...

458
00:26:48,520 --> 00:26:49,800
Yeah, I mean, of course you could.

459
00:26:53,040 --> 00:26:58,340
Well uh this is a picture of the Lemon

460
00:26:58,340 --> 00:27:02,360
House uh the Allegheny Portage Railroad you see

461
00:27:02,360 --> 00:27:02,520
they

462
00:27:02,520 --> 00:27:05,020
went for a while on by canal and then they took

463
00:27:05,020 --> 00:27:07,260
the railroad and then they got back on the canal

464
00:27:07,260 --> 00:27:10,640
it was a really crazy mixed up method of

465
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:16,240
transportation but uh he's the first thing he

466
00:27:16,240 --> 00:27:19,420
mentions here is the little scamps that

467
00:27:19,420 --> 00:27:25,460
hauled up my trunk that trunk wanted me to pay

468
00:27:25,460 --> 00:27:26,020
them for

469
00:27:26,020 --> 00:27:31,980
so doing 50 cents this I refused told them I

470
00:27:31,980 --> 00:27:35,860
would give them 25 cents and for that sum I

471
00:27:35,860 --> 00:27:36,280
could have

472
00:27:36,280 --> 00:27:40,760
gotten a hack to haul it they grumbled but put

473
00:27:40,760 --> 00:27:44,520
off finally with 25 cents so he got his way he

474
00:27:44,520 --> 00:27:46,280
paid them 25 cents.

475
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:53,140
On board, and that picture of all the people

476
00:27:53,140 --> 00:27:54,020
sitting on the top

477
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,500
is so typical.

478
00:27:55,580 --> 00:27:56,520
That's the way they

479
00:27:56,870 --> 00:28:00,970
traveled. Traveled. On board, we had a lot of

480
00:28:00,970 --> 00:28:04,090
Pittsburghers, such as Mansfield Brown and

481
00:28:04,090 --> 00:28:07,650
White, George B. White, Lewis Hutchison Jr. and

482
00:28:07,650 --> 00:28:10,570
mother, and from Cincinnati, Rev. Dr. Rice and

483
00:28:10,570 --> 00:28:11,110
two sons.

484
00:28:11,770 --> 00:28:15,650
We reached Johnstown on Wednesday morning at 2

485
00:28:15,650 --> 00:28:19,990
o'clock and took cars immediately, reached the

486
00:28:19,990 --> 00:28:21,210
