487
00:28:21,210 --> 00:28:24,830
And then he gets into some personal things.

488
00:28:24,950 --> 00:28:27,010
He took time to visit his mother

489
00:28:27,010 --> 00:28:29,330
and then he went back on

490
00:28:29,330 --> 00:28:32,150
and got on to the Susquehanna packet

491
00:28:32,150 --> 00:28:35,030
