492
00:28:35,030 --> 00:28:36,670
and here he says,

493
00:28:36,830 --> 00:28:39,490
we were tormented almost to death

494
00:28:39,490 --> 00:28:41,530
with 75 riflemen

495
00:28:41,530 --> 00:28:44,670
as wicked, profane and abandoned

496
00:28:44,670 --> 00:28:47,550
as it is possible to conceive.

497
00:28:48,490 --> 00:28:50,710
And can't you see he's on,

498
00:28:51,210 --> 00:28:53,270
public transportation here and here's a whole

499
00:28:53,270 --> 00:28:56,530
group of military men who are rather wild

500
00:28:56,530 --> 00:28:59,810
and drinking and carrying on and says, wicked,

501
00:28:59,810 --> 00:29:01,950
profane and abandoned.

502
00:29:06,030 --> 00:29:11,770
He tells about making a trip up to New York

503
00:29:11,770 --> 00:29:16,110
